5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let’s start by looking at how last year’s days ran and the time alone in the shared-house year.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I’d like to check the all-in rates against meals bought separately, and what separately booked rooms cost last time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
