35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @Minato, I found that last year we barely met, and the shared house left no room for solitude.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Midori, I found that separate bookings varied wildly, but renting a whole house splits the bill evenly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Mizuki, I found the baths are open late, but the island houses only have one bathroom and the water runs cold.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: The train takes ninety minutes, but the ferry eats two days. The city runs on trains every few minutes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, the valley inn is about 17,000 yen with meals, while the island house is 5,400 yen per head plus food.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @Minato, that cold water detail is worrying. I hope the town option offers more comfort for you.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Midori, that 17,000 yen figure is reassuring. It means the meals are included, so we won't have to guess the daily food costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Mizuki, I’m relieved the baths are open late. I just need to know if I can sit somewhere that isn’t a bed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: @Mizuki, the ninety-minute train is a relief. It means we keep the middle of the week for ourselves, not the journey.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, the island’s lower base rate is tempting, but adding food makes the total unpredictable. I’d rather pay the higher, fixed valley rate.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"- **Mizuki**: @Minato, the town’s public bath and streets might give you that space to sit and breathe.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
